# Root build context (docker/api.Dockerfile, tasks.md F17.2). Keeps local
# data, secrets and the frontend's node_modules out of the context sent to
# the daemon -- the API image only needs pyproject.toml, src/ and config/.
.git
.github
.claude
.env
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
*.egg-info
.pytest_cache
data
logs
frontend
docs
tests
*.zip
*.json
!config/**/*.json
